# the instance folder of the demonstration service backend
# (doc_page_impl_service_instance.md). trying the Services tab creates
# instances here: each one a copy of its template with its own service.yaml,
# and with its data (notes.sqlite) once it ran. everything new is ignored;
# only the files of the two instances listed below are part of the example.
# their data, their dashboard builds and installed dependencies stay ignored.
# to add an instance to the example on purpose, list its folder here.

*
!*/
!/.gitignore

!/note-db-inst-w4veemd7i36/**
!/note-db-inst-w4veemdrx8y/**
/*/*.sqlite
/*/*.sqlite-journal
/*/dashboard/dist/
/*/dashboard/node_modules/
/*/__pycache__/
